            id = "voice-notes",
            title = "Voice notes",
            keywords = listOf("voice note", "voice notes", "voice memo", "record a note", "take a voice note", "ramble", "dictate", "dictation", "recording"),
            what = "talk a rambling note and Navilife turns it into words on the phone or the Mac, then offers the tasks, dates and reminders in it as cards for you to add. The recording is kept for 30 days.",
            how = "Open Capture (the widget, the quick-settings tile or Share) and hold the 🎙: it records until you tap Done (Pause stops it for a moment, five minutes at most). Or say \"take a voice note\" to Talk. When you stop, the words appear and Navilife reads them: Add the cards you want; anything you leave waits in Needs you.",
            tips = listOf("The recording and its words stay on the device that made it (the phone or the Mac), encrypted, and go after 30 days; tap Keep on a note in Ask → Daily → Voice notes to hold on to it. Only the words, never the recording, go to Navilife's AI.", "Turning speech into words happens on the device: Android's own recogniser on the phone (Android 13 or later), Dictation's English on the Mac. If it can't, the recording is still kept and you can play it back.", "No signal? The note is still recorded and turned into words; tap Make cards on it in Voice notes once you're back online.", "Navilife's AI tidies the note into a few short lines and says who it mentions; your own words stay under \"Your words\". Ideas with no date can go to Lists → Someday → Ideas with one tap.", "A quick tap on the 🎙 is the short way: say one thing (\"buy milk tomorrow\", \"add eggs to the shopping\"); your words show in the field as you speak and, about a second after you stop, it is added, with Undo and Edit for a few seconds (tap the 🎙 again to finish sooner). With \"Add what you ask for\" on Ask first (What Navilife may do), it fills the capture field for your ↑ Add instead.", "On the Galaxy Watch, tap 🎙 Voice note under Capture (or say \"take a voice note\" to Capture) and talk until you tap Done: the watch writes the words down itself (nothing is recorded), Navilife tidies them and the cards wait in Needs you on the phone. With no signal the words are kept as a task."),
